---
title: Speaking
layout: layouts/base.njk
seoTitle: Speaking | Parul Soni Manvati
seoDescription: "From the future of food and alternative proteins to supply chains, MSMEs and emerging industries, Parul speaks about what it takes to build, scale and transform the systems shaping our future."
---
{% import "partials/media-placeholder.njk" as media %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">SPEAKING <span style="opacity: 0.55; margin: 0 0.5em;">|</span> PARUL SONI MANVATI</span>
      <h1 class="hero__headline">Conversations worth having.</h1>
      <p class="hero__subtext">From the future of food and alternative proteins to supply chains, MSMEs and emerging industries, Parul speaks about what it takes to build, scale and transform the systems shaping our future.</p>
      <p style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.02rem; max-width: 52ch;">Her perspective comes from operating inside businesses, building new categories, working across large organisations and startups, and engaging with industry ecosystems.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <div class="hero__image-wrap">
        {{ media.placeholder("Parul speaking on stage", "4/5", "No real speaking photograph is in the project yet. Replace before this goes fully live.") }}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% set safeTopics = speakingTopics.items | publiclySafe %}
{% if safeTopics.length %}
<section class="tier-dominant">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">What I speak about</span>
      <h2>Ideas worth putting in a room together.</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="speaking-topics-list">
      {% for topic in safeTopics %}
      <details class="speaking-topic">
        <summary class="speaking-topic__summary">
          <span class="speaking-topic__number">{{ "0" + (loop.index | string) if loop.index < 10 else loop.index }}</span>
          <span class="speaking-topic__headline">
            <strong>{{ topic.title }}</strong>
            <span class="speaking-topic__keywords">{{ topic.keywords }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="speaking-topic__icon" aria-hidden="true">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div class="speaking-topic__body">
          <p>{{ topic.description }}</p>
          {% if topic.talks.length %}
          <div class="speaking-topic__talks">
            <span>Possible conversations</span>
            <ul>
              {% for talk in topic.talks %}
              <li>{{ talk }}</li>
              {% endfor %}
            </ul>
          </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </details>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
{% endif %}

<section class="tier-secondary">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <span class="section-label">Speaking &amp; Conversations</span>
      <h2>From the work to the stage.</h2>
      <p>Parul's speaking is grounded in the industries, organisations and systems she has worked inside, not commentary from the sidelines.</p>
    </div>
    {% set publishedEvents = speakingEvents.items | selectattr("published") | publiclySafe %}
    {% if publishedEvents.length %}
    <div class="appearance-list">
      {% for event in publishedEvents %}
      <div class="appearance-card">
        <span class="appearance-card__year">{{ event.year or "TBD" }}</span>
        <div>
          <h3 class="appearance-card__title">{{ event.title }}{% if event.organisation %} · {{ event.organisation }}{% endif %}</h3>
          {% if event.topic %}<p class="appearance-card__meta">{{ event.topic }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if event.location %}<p class="appearance-card__meta">{{ event.location }}</p>{% endif %}
          {% if event.videoUrl %}
          <a class="appearance-card__link" href="{{ event.videoUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Watch talk →</a>
          {% elif event.externalUrl %}
          <a class="appearance-card__link" href="{{ event.externalUrl }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Learn more →</a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    {% else %}
    <div class="empty-state">Selected speaking appearances will appear here as they're confirmed.</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="tier-dominant section--sage">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="section-label">Speaking</span>
    <h2>Bring this conversation to your room.</h2>
    <p style="max-width: 56ch; margin-top: 1rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">For conferences, leadership forums, industry conversations, panels and ecosystem events.</p>
    <div class="teaser__ctas">
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/?intent=speaking">Invite Parul to Speak →</a>
      <a class="btn btn--secondary" href="/contact/">Start a Conversation →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
